# ── .NET build output ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Confirmed present right now: bin/ is 255MB, obj/ is 5.8MB - pure build
# output, regenerated by `dotnet build` every time.
bin/
obj/

# ── Visual Studio / IDE ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
.vs/
*.user
*.suo
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates
.vscode/
.idea/

# ── Phase 2: ONNX backbones + converted memory banks ────────────────────
# Not generated yet, but WPF_INTEGRATION_PLAN.md's Phase 2 will drop these
# into Assets/ - patchcore_model.pt alone is 925MB on the Python side, and
# GitHub hard-rejects anything over 100MB per file. Keep these on shared
# storage instead; Assets/reference_color.json (small, needed to run) and
# config.json stay tracked.
*.onnx
*.onnx.data
*.pt
*.pth
*.pkl
Assets/*.bin
Assets/RGB

# ── OS junk ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store

# ── Logs ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
Assets/*.bin